   "text": "MULTI-AGENT\n\nA boss agent splits work\nbetween expert agents.\n\nEx: Boss -> Price agent\n+ Review agent + Seller\nagent (like ScanCart)",
   "originalText": "MULTI-AGENT\n\nA boss agent splits work\nbetween expert agents.\n\nEx: Boss -> Price agent\n+ Review agent + Seller\nagent (like ScanCart)",
