   "text": "A2A\n\nA standard for one\ncompany's agent to talk\nto another's agent.\n\nEx: Grocery agent asks\nthe delivery company's\nagent for a slot",
   "originalText": "A2A\n\nA standard for one\ncompany's agent to talk\nto another's agent.\n\nEx: Grocery agent asks\nthe delivery company's\nagent for a slot",
