   "text": "STATE STORE\n\nSave the agent's\nprogress so it can pause\nand continue.\n\nEx: thread #77 is at\nstep 3 (Postgres /\nRedis, LangGraph\ncheckpoint)",
   "originalText": "STATE STORE\n\nSave the agent's\nprogress so it can pause\nand continue.\n\nEx: thread #77 is at\nstep 3 (Postgres /\nRedis, LangGraph\ncheckpoint)",
