   "text": "QUEUE / DURABLE\n\nLong jobs run in the\nbackground and survive\ncrashes.\n\nEx: wait 10 min for\npayment, then resume\n(Inngest / Temporal)",
   "originalText": "QUEUE / DURABLE\n\nLong jobs run in the\nbackground and survive\ncrashes.\n\nEx: wait 10 min for\npayment, then resume\n(Inngest / Temporal)",
