   "text": "LOGS & EVALS\n\nWatch every step and\ntest the agent like\nnormal code.\n\nEx: trace in Langfuse;\nrun 50 sample orders\nbefore each release",
   "originalText": "LOGS & EVALS\n\nWatch every step and\ntest the agent like\nnormal code.\n\nEx: trace in Langfuse;\nrun 50 sample orders\nbefore each release",
