   "text": "COST CONTROL\n\nUse small models for\neasy steps, big ones for\nhard steps, cache\nprompts.\n\nEx: Haiku reads the\nlist, Opus plans tricky\norders",
   "originalText": "COST CONTROL\n\nUse small models for\neasy steps, big ones for\nhard steps, cache\nprompts.\n\nEx: Haiku reads the\nlist, Opus plans tricky\norders",
