   "text": "HUMAN APPROVAL\n\nA person says yes before\nanything risky or\ncostly.\n\nEx: \"Pay Rs 170?\" Riya\nmust tap Yes",
   "originalText": "HUMAN APPROVAL\n\nA person says yes before\nanything risky or\ncostly.\n\nEx: \"Pay Rs 170?\" Riya\nmust tap Yes",
